ormat":"opus","type":"audio","duration":106,"fileSize":977927,"channels":"mono","overlayLabel":"55","ambient":null,"display":null}]}]},"metadata":{"media":{"duration":2184,"fileSize":20238670},"author":"Momma Bear Audio","description":"Pack your bags! It’s time for the ultimate cross-country adventure! Suzy just returned from an unforgettable road trip across the United States, but there’s one big problem… six of her favorite Audio Cards have gone missing!\n\nShe has hired you to help find them! Travel through all 48 continental states as you search famous landmarks, national parks, historic towns, beaches, mountains, and hidden treasures. From the towering cliffs of Zion National Park to the rocky shores of Maine, every stop teaches fun facts about each state’s capital city, unique attractions, and what makes it special.\n\nListen carefully to the clues, imagine yourself exploring each destination, and help recover every missing Audio Card before heading home.\n\nThis interactive adventure is perfect for curious kids who love geography, travel, and solving mysteries. Along the way, they’ll discover iconic places across America while building listening skills and learning about the incredible diversity of the United States.\n\nCan you find all six lost Audio Cards before the journey ends?\n\nIncludes:-All 48 continental U.S. states-Printable map to search through-State capitals and famous landmarks-Interactive search-and-find adventure-Perfect for road trips, quiet time, or classroom learning-Recommended for ages 5–10\n\n*This audio includes a printable map to use with the audio.No more Yoto links can be shared from this point on. But I’m working to find a way to make it just as easy! Stay tuned!\n\nRun Time: 45 min\n\nLooking for other free audio sources, ideas and inspo? Maybe you want to submit a request for some sort of specific audio for your kids? Join my FB Group! I am always taking suggestions and working to get the audio your kids want.\nToyo Momma Bear source: 829c6d2e7dd53cc32415389b86616485fb609558f273f160676a9e1deee8183a","abridged":false,"narrators":[],"copyrights":[],"accents":[],"cover":{"imageL":"https://card-content.yotoplay.com/1zqqbCph2mgIoxFuhjAdRyDcVXjke14J9FxcqZmckwuE~/pub/N6LrDAlSNWYk_PQ4-BlBJ5JYq7XLbsUQq2J1db9fx9k"},"authors":["Momma Bear Audio"]}}}